# Security headers for every response served by Cloudflare Pages.
# Semrush site audit flagged Strict-Transport-Security as missing on / and the
# product hubs; HSTS is emitted here (max-age only — no includeSubDomains so the
# media subdomain keeps its own policy).
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Edge caching for HTML.
#
# Cloudflare Pages answers every static asset with
#   Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
# by default. The edge reads that as "do not store" and marks each request
# cf-cache-status: DYNAMIC, so even Googlebot hits the origin every single
# time. Measured TTFB then sits at 1.2-2.4s for a normal page and 5-9.5s for
# the heavy hubs (/products/strollers/ alone is 113KB), and Google responds to
# a slow origin by throttling itself. That is why 243 URLs have been stuck in
# "Discovered - currently not indexed" with Last crawled = N/A since July:
# they were never fetched, not fetched and rejected.
#
# max-age=0 keeps the browser always revalidating, so publishing news or a
# guide and re-deploying reflects immediately; every Cloudflare Pages deploy
# purges the edge cache anyway. s-maxage is what puts the HTML into the
# Cloudflare cache. Cloudflare-CDN-Cache-Control is spelled out as well
# because it unambiguously wins over the browser-facing Cache-Control when
# the edge decides whether to store the response.
#
# Keep one splat per rule and keep the patterns disjoint: two rules matching
# the same URL would join their Cache-Control values with a comma and both
# would be lost. These seven prefixes plus the two exact root URLs cover every
# URL in the sitemap, in both the clean form (/products/strollers/) and the
# .html form actually served after a _redirects rewrite.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate, s-maxage=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800
  Cloudflare-CDN-Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800

/index.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate, s-maxage=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800
  Cloudflare-CDN-Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800

